      "common:generalComment": [
        {
          "#text": "Lubricating oil is a liquid product derived from the refining and processing of petroleum, primarily used to reduce friction and wear. It contains various hydrocarbons along with additives that enhance oxidation resistance, cleanliness, and foam control, allowing it to perform well under harsh operating conditions. As an essential maintenance material, lubricating oil plays a vital role in automobiles, industrial equipment, and other machinery.",
          "@xml:lang": "en"
        },
        {
          "#text": "润滑油则是通过对石油精炼和加工得到的液态产品，主要用于减少摩擦和磨损。润滑油中包含多种碳氢化合物，以及抗氧化、清洁和抗泡沫的添加剂，这些特性使其能够在严苛的工作条件下保持良好的性能。作为重要的机械维护材料，润滑油在汽车、工业设备及其他机械中扮演着至关重要的角色。",
          "@xml:lang": "zh"
        }
      ],
